{"id":87,"slug":"ma-jain-zh","resourceId":56,"nameNative":"马坚译（中文）","nameAr":"ما جيان","nameEn":"Chinese Translation (Ma Jian)","lang":"zh","source":"Quran.com API v4","sourceUrl":"https://quran.com","verses":[{"verseNumber":1,"verseKey":"87:1","text":"你当赞颂你至尊主的大名超绝万物，"},{"verseNumber":2,"verseKey":"87:2","text":"他创造万物，并使各物匀称。"},{"verseNumber":3,"verseKey":"87:3","text":"他预定万物，而加以引导。"},{"verseNumber":4,"verseKey":"87:4","text":"他生出牧草，"},{"verseNumber":5,"verseKey":"87:5","text":"然後使它变成黑色的枯草。"},{"verseNumber":6,"verseKey":"87:6","text":"我将使你诵读，故你不会忘记，"},{"verseNumber":7,"verseKey":"87:7","text":"除非真主所欲你忘记的。他的确知道显著的和隐微的言行。"},{"verseNumber":8,"verseKey":"87:8","text":"我将使你遵循平易的道路，"},{"verseNumber":9,"verseKey":"87:9","text":"故你当教诲众人，如果教诲有裨於他们的话。"},{"verseNumber":10,"verseKey":"87:10","text":"畏主的人，将觉悟；"},{"verseNumber":11,"verseKey":"87:11","text":"薄命的人，将退避，"},{"verseNumber":12,"verseKey":"87:12","text":"他将入於大火，"},{"verseNumber":13,"verseKey":"87:13","text":"然後，在火里不死也不活。"},{"verseNumber":14,"verseKey":"87:14","text":"有教养的人确已成功，"},{"verseNumber":15,"verseKey":"87:15","text":"他记念他的主的尊名，而谨守拜功。"},{"verseNumber":16,"verseKey":"87:16","text":"不然，你们却选择今世的生活；"},{"verseNumber":17,"verseKey":"87:17","text":"其实，後世是更好的，是更久长的。"},{"verseNumber":18,"verseKey":"87:18","text":"这确是载在古经典中的，"},{"verseNumber":19,"verseKey":"87:19","text":"载在易卜拉欣和穆萨的经典中的。"}]}